WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Scope and budget. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Define what a project estimate includes

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A useful project estimate starts with scope: what is included, excluded, when, and for which build quantity.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Four illustrative parts at $120 each plus $80 fixed setup = $560, before taxes, labor, shipping or contingency.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Scope card sort

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Define what a project estimate includes
